{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.webp?t=1773393755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras_big/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.webp?t=1773393755 width=800 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/84791085f9801e63ddb25d7f5c7110e2.avif?t=1773393755\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shell Bless: The Faithless</strong> is run-based action roguelite shooter set in a twisted world where Norse gods answer prayers with overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.webp?t=1773393755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras_big/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.webp?t=1773393755 width=800 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/25bd29819bbccb450956cce9af9be469.avif?t=1773393755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras_big/25bd29819bbccb450956cce9af9be469.avif?t=1773393755 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.webp?t=1773393755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras_big/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.webp?t=1773393755 width=800 height=12 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOTGUNS AND MYTH COLLIDE: AN EPIC BATTLE ACROSS THE NINE REALMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm corrupted by heresy, you are not a savior \u2014 you are an executioner chosen by the gods. Wield shotguns as sacred instruments, perform divine rituals through blessings, and face powerful bosses threatening the Nine Realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new chance to craft your build. Choose blessings from Odin, Thor, Tyr, and Freyja and combine runes, magic, and hidden O-parts to create synergistic shotgun builds that scale from desperate survival to unstoppable destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/2a74ac54d6d26de936ce891eb03f2d0b.poster.avif?t=1773393755\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/2a74ac54d6d26de936ce891eb03f2d0b.webm?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/2a74ac54d6d26de936ce891eb03f2d0b.mp4?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat &amp; Power Scaling</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based, high-intensity 3rd-person shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack blessings, upgrades, and gear to become overwhelmingly powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of turning chaos into domination</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/c21d50423fb8dfd73872ff43d23b0341.poster.avif?t=1773393755\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/c21d50423fb8dfd73872ff43d23b0341.webm?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/c21d50423fb8dfd73872ff43d23b0341.mp4?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Roguelite Runs</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons ensure high replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden objects (O-parts), lore, and unexpected combat scenarios every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each god's blessing grants you unique skills and the power to turn the tide of battle.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your combat style with the gods' might.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden gears (O-parts) in dungeons to upgrade your shotgun and equipment.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/bea3c794488eeee2ded1a42e68abd2ea.poster.avif?t=1773393755\" width=774 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/bea3c794488eeee2ded1a42e68abd2ea.webm?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/bea3c794488eeee2ded1a42e68abd2ea.mp4?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOTIC 4-PLAYER CO-OP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to defeat waves of enemies and experience dynamic moments driven by teamwork.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate builds or accidentally ruin everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared chaos creates unpredictable and unforgettable moments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/71afebcb5b27c5a8e0ce494826700a0f.avif?t=1773393755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras_big/71afebcb5b27c5a8e0ce494826700a0f.avif?t=1773393755 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style Your Viking</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize armor, helmets, and cloaks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look as unstoppable as you feel</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/d0deec178ab20b4d4e34fda5f02baafb.poster.avif?t=1773393755\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/d0deec178ab20b4d4e34fda5f02baafb.webm?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/d0deec178ab20b4d4e34fda5f02baafb.mp4?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shotgun is loaded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bless the faithless - one run at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/3eaeb031d137fad37b5f9a89c87d90af.poster.avif?t=1773393755\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/3eaeb031d137fad37b5f9a89c87d90af.webm?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/3eaeb031d137fad37b5f9a89c87d90af.mp4?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.webp?t=1773393755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras_big/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.webp?t=1773393755 width=800 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dive into a chaotic world where legendary shotguns and Norse mythology collide? The warrior's journey to bless the heretics of the Nine Realms is about to begin!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/b56eea5375f46ebb659e62dcb75defbb.poster.avif?t=1773393755\" width=638 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/b56eea5375f46ebb659e62dcb75defbb.webm?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/b56eea5375f46ebb659e62dcb75defbb.mp4?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.webp?t=1773393755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras_big/f807fa641