ombat scenarios every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each god's blessing grants you unique skills and the power to turn the tide of battle.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your combat style with the gods' might.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden gears (O-parts) in dungeons to upgrade your shotgun and equipment.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/bea3c794488eeee2ded1a42e68abd2ea.poster.avif?t=1773393755\" width=774 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/bea3c794488eeee2ded1a42e68abd2ea.webm?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/bea3c794488eeee2ded1a42e68abd2ea.mp4?t=1773393755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOTIC 4-PLAYER CO-OP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to defeat waves of enemies and experience dynamic moments driven by teamwork.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate builds or accidentally ruin everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared chaos creates unpredictable and unforgettable moments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras/71afebcb5b27c5a8e0ce494826700a0f.avif?t=1773393755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415350/extras_big/71afebcb5b27c5a8e0ce494826700a0f.avif?t=1773393755 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style Your Viking</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize armor, helmets, 